  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'RAIN RING (Water, the ''bullets'' form)

    A ring of bullets appears round the enemy you face, hangs, then all fly inward together.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Put it in a spell slot at a rest, then cast it with that slot ( + , , , ). 30 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1164002948}
  text: {fileID: 1750088740}
  back: {fileID: 1402561905}
  shown: {fileID: 1656144083}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
